  "content": "\n\n<p>这是一款带有扫描线、变形效果和完整鱼眼功能的VHS着色器，它采用Minecraft经典的阴影与光照系统，因此性能表现应该不错。（如果存在Bug或某些功能无法正常运行，请在评论区反馈）建议搭配我的模组使用此着色器<br><br>- VHS Backrooms：伪纪录片风格<br><br><br>本着色器兼容<br><br>-Iris<br>-Oculus<br><br>-Optifine（可能不兼容，因为未在该环境下进行测试）<br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7a9d5280-06af-4b79-a0f4-a5c4ead54765.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"339\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1f2e723b-e1f6-4188-878f-1e6f907ac12d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"339\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b656681d-2615-46a7-a7e1-cf1b28970727.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"339\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_10cf296a-c725-42fa-bf76-641b17054ab9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"339\"></p>",
